From: mosdns v2 rebuild
Subject: [PATCH] safely invalidate configured cache dumps before startup

MOSDNS_INVALIDATE_CACHE=1 requires successful invalidation of each configured
dump before plugin initialization can succeed. Reject non-regular final path
entries, preserve unsafe targets, and publish dumps by atomic rename rather
than truncating through symlinks. Parent-directory symlinks remain supported
for OpenWrt layouts such as /var -> /tmp.

